### 录音转写服务 API 调试（当前仅开放上传）
### 需先启动服务：http://127.0.0.1:8000
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 上传录音（请改成本地真实音频路径）
# @name upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/recordings
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./uploads/demo.mp3
------Boundary--

### 从上传响应取出 id
@recordingId = {{upload.response.body.recording_id}}
@taskId = {{upload.response.body.task_id}}

